<title>JAPAN: S&amp;P assigns AA to NSW Treasury Corp samurais.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P assigns AA to NSW Treasury Corp samurais.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's Corp said on Monday it had assigned its AA rating to New South Wales Treasury Corp's 25 billion yen 5.6 percent yen/Australian dollar dual currency bond due on May 10, 2000.</p>
<p>S&amp;P said the outlook for the rating was positive.</p>
</text>
